WEBVTT

00:00:11.814 --> 00:00:13.084
Where's Barret?

00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:16.724
He should be making his first
foray into battle around now.

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:25.334
Finally found him.

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:26.394
Mary!

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:33.164
Be a good boy and become
food for my water dragon!

00:00:35.174 --> 00:00:37.144
Water Dragon!

00:00:47.884 --> 00:00:50.184
Do you know this story?

00:00:51.294 --> 00:00:53.564
It was Christmas night,

00:00:53.564 --> 00:00:57.694
and a poor little girl was
selling matches on the street.

00:00:59.964 --> 00:01:04.994
It seems that no sad story
will resonate in your heart.

00:01:05.304 --> 00:01:06.964
Drop dead, you old fool!

00:01:13.884 --> 00:01:17.284
Impossible! He can match
my power, at his age?!

00:01:38.904 --> 00:01:42.514
Barret, you've proved your
power more than enough.

00:01:42.514 --> 00:01:45.074
Now quit playing around and retreat at once.

00:01:49.314 --> 00:01:51.184
W-Wait!

00:01:54.454 --> 00:02:01.554
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:02.564 --> 00:02:08.434
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:10.874 --> 00:02:16.674
Meeting you like I did

00:02:17.014 --> 00:02:21.884
Wasn't just so we could live

00:02:23.154 --> 00:02:28.674
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:02:29.094 --> 00:02:33.684
And surely change the future

00:02:34.294 --> 00:02:37.194
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:02:37.194 --> 00:02:40.324
Is released (changing yourself)

00:02:40.464 --> 00:02:46.204
An angel's shining surges through me

00:02:47.644 --> 00:02:50.214
The "wings" that will save the world

00:02:50.214 --> 00:02:53.044
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:02:53.284 --> 00:02:59.444
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:02:59.584 --> 00:03:02.384
The power given to me

00:03:02.384 --> 00:03:05.024
Spurs me into the sky

00:03:05.024 --> 00:03:10.754
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:03:11.094 --> 00:03:16.624
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:03:25.174 --> 00:03:25.614
37th sense: "A Mighty Enemy Attacks!
Black Phantom"

00:03:25.614 --> 00:03:27.274
37th sense: "A Mighty Enemy Attacks!
Black Phantom"
Huh? Black Phantom?

00:03:27.814 --> 00:03:28.784
Yes.

00:03:28.784 --> 00:03:30.784
It's a mysterious esper crime syndicate

00:03:30.784 --> 00:03:33.374
that's been secretly spreading
its influence lately.

00:03:33.584 --> 00:03:36.954
Yes. Our nation is already
investigating them as well.

00:03:36.954 --> 00:03:39.164
Although I've heard they're
a brutal criminal gang

00:03:39.164 --> 00:03:41.854
maneuvering secretly on the dark
side of international society.

00:03:42.094 --> 00:03:44.324
We believe Japan may be next on their list.

00:03:45.294 --> 00:03:47.234
Japan? But why?

00:03:47.564 --> 00:03:52.804
Minamoto, please be careful.
This is a warning as a friend.

00:03:53.474 --> 00:03:54.234
Ken.

00:03:54.504 --> 00:03:57.214
NEXT MORNING - 08:30 JAPAN TIME
And as President Salmonella
continues his tour of all nations,

00:03:57.214 --> 00:03:59.804
he has taken off for Japan,
the next stop on the trip.

00:04:00.044 --> 00:04:01.814
APPROXIMATELY 5 HOURS LATER,
IN FRONT OF TOKYO RECEPTION HALL

00:04:04.214 --> 00:04:05.874
The Children, released!

00:04:10.694 --> 00:04:13.284
You're not as into this as usual.

00:04:13.924 --> 00:04:17.024
Why can't we go into the party hall?

00:04:17.194 --> 00:04:19.424
I even bought some lucky underwear for it!

00:04:20.134 --> 00:04:22.194
You don't need something like that!

00:04:22.504 --> 00:04:25.994
By the way, here's the receipt.
Can you expense it for me?

00:04:26.344 --> 00:04:28.064
And you put my name on it?!

00:04:28.504 --> 00:04:32.004
And why does something that
skimpy cost so much?!

00:04:32.274 --> 00:04:33.434
My underpants!

00:04:33.584 --> 00:04:35.014
Give 'em back!

00:04:35.914 --> 00:04:39.224
I really wanted to eat a feast at the party.

00:04:39.224 --> 00:04:43.814
Yeah. I guess we only rate getting this stuff.

00:04:45.824 --> 00:04:47.624
Your mission is to act as the
personal bodyguard

00:04:47.624 --> 00:04:49.784
for President Salmonella,
who's about to arrive in Japan.

00:04:50.234 --> 00:04:52.634
He's a man with a lot of enemies.

00:04:52.964 --> 00:04:56.024
Which is why we have to guard
him from Black Whatchamacallit?

00:04:56.274 --> 00:05:00.334
Yes. The probability that the president
is their target is less than 3%,

00:05:00.404 --> 00:05:03.244
But that's still a 3% chance
that his life is in danger!

00:05:03.514 --> 00:05:06.034
To ensure nothing goes wrong,
you three will wait here.

00:05:07.344 --> 00:05:09.254
Are you even listening? Hey!

00:05:09.254 --> 00:05:11.954
But it's just a 3% chance!

00:05:11.954 --> 00:05:13.284
You can have my dehydrated green onion.

00:05:13.284 --> 00:05:14.784
No, thanks! Hey! Cut it out!

00:05:14.784 --> 00:05:15.954
But I don't like the taste!

00:05:15.954 --> 00:05:17.954
Children never appreciate the
concerns of their elders.

00:05:17.954 --> 00:05:21.224
It'd be nice if this ended up with
us being overly cautious.

00:05:21.224 --> 00:05:22.664
But, the problem is...

00:05:23.634 --> 00:05:24.494
Yeah.

00:05:24.494 --> 00:05:28.404
We adults can't depend on
those children this time.

00:05:28.404 --> 00:05:29.874
Um, sir?

00:05:29.874 --> 00:05:30.634
Yes?

00:05:30.704 --> 00:05:32.944
I'm afraid we can't refund your money.

00:05:32.944 --> 00:05:34.704
I see.

00:05:35.444 --> 00:05:38.374
But I think it suits you very nicely, sir.

00:05:40.084 --> 00:05:42.544
How many times must I say
that these aren't mine?!

00:05:43.754 --> 00:05:45.684
Dammit, that was a waste of time!

00:05:46.024 --> 00:05:48.454
Hurry up and get me back to the standby point!

00:05:49.694 --> 00:05:51.124
Even if they're Level 7's,

00:05:51.194 --> 00:05:53.764
I won't knowingly send them on
a life-threatening mission!

00:05:53.764 --> 00:05:56.384
Right. Nor should you.

00:05:57.234 --> 00:05:58.494
Hyobu?! You!

00:06:03.374 --> 00:06:04.204
Forget it.

00:06:05.074 --> 00:06:07.194
Just calm down.

00:06:07.674 --> 00:06:09.874
Black Phantom is definitely coming.

00:06:11.074 --> 00:06:14.444
So keep the children away from there.

00:06:14.444 --> 00:06:16.414
We'll provide the reason for you.

00:06:17.254 --> 00:06:19.084
Why would you do that?

00:06:19.354 --> 00:06:23.684
We're not the only ones using
ESP for illegal activities.

00:06:24.094 --> 00:06:28.054
We need to demonstrate our
strength to our rivals.

00:06:28.624 --> 00:06:30.184
Look at it that way.

00:06:30.794 --> 00:06:35.634
Besides, this is going to be
a genuinely dirty job.

00:06:36.274 --> 00:06:38.834
He and The Children must
not be allowed to fight!

00:06:38.834 --> 00:06:39.734
Under any circumstances!

00:06:39.874 --> 00:06:40.644
OVER SAGAMI BAY - 15:14

00:06:40.644 --> 00:06:42.504
OVER SAGAMI BAY - 15:14
President Salmonella's plane, on approach.

00:06:42.504 --> 00:06:43.314
President Salmonella's plane, on approach.

00:06:43.314 --> 00:06:45.214
Roger. Runway is currently...

00:06:49.754 --> 00:06:52.314
Unit 2! What's wrong?! Unit 2!

00:06:58.854 --> 00:07:00.864
Wake up!

00:07:00.864 --> 00:07:03.034
The Children are in the middle of a mission!

00:07:03.034 --> 00:07:06.204
No, Chief. We have to wake him up more gently.

00:07:06.204 --> 00:07:08.304
How about a kiss?! We could kiss him awake!

00:07:08.304 --> 00:07:10.894
I don't think I'm prepared for that.

00:07:13.444 --> 00:07:15.274
Okay! Now I am!

00:07:15.274 --> 00:07:15.974
That was quick.
Okay! Now I am!

00:07:15.974 --> 00:07:16.914
Okay!

00:07:16.914 --> 00:07:18.014
Hey!

00:07:18.014 --> 00:07:19.714
Wake up, sleepyhead.

00:07:19.714 --> 00:07:21.874
Damn! She was faster!

00:07:23.184 --> 00:07:25.284
Quit just thinking about yourself!

00:07:25.284 --> 00:07:26.414
You are such a...

00:07:27.124 --> 00:07:29.314
Where? When did I get here?

00:07:29.654 --> 00:07:30.784
That's what I'd like to know!

00:07:31.094 --> 00:07:35.024
Chief! The escort planes were
suddenly attacked over the sea!

00:07:36.234 --> 00:07:38.564
The President's plane landed
safely at the airport.

00:07:38.564 --> 00:07:41.504
They want The Children to help
rescue the downed planes!

00:07:41.504 --> 00:07:43.274
They were ambushed?!

00:07:43.274 --> 00:07:44.824
Get a fix on where it happened!

00:07:47.304 --> 00:07:48.504
Okay, we're going!

00:07:48.974 --> 00:07:50.634
Aoi, wait! I need to tell the chief...

00:07:51.114 --> 00:07:53.944
ESP bodyguard division! Look extra sharp!

00:07:54.284 --> 00:07:56.404
Yes, sir! Roger.

00:07:56.984 --> 00:08:00.554
Everyone, it's almost time for
the president to arrive.

00:08:00.554 --> 00:08:01.914
I want you all to immediately...

00:08:03.524 --> 00:08:05.544
It's him! Get into the rifle's blind spot!

00:08:08.194 --> 00:08:09.854
The bullet's moving by itself!

00:08:24.214 --> 00:08:27.334
Let's give President Salmonella
a round of applause!

00:08:32.284 --> 00:08:33.614
Mr. President, get down!

00:08:35.184 --> 00:08:35.784
Are you?!

00:08:38.024 --> 00:08:39.464
Prime Minister, get out of here!

00:08:39.464 --> 00:08:40.984
Wait, this is...

00:08:47.364 --> 00:08:48.354
Fooled you.

00:08:48.534 --> 00:08:51.634
That hurt! If it hadn't been for
Magi's handmade armor,

00:08:51.634 --> 00:08:53.504
I really would have died, old man!

00:08:53.944 --> 00:08:56.004
Quit calling me old man!

00:08:59.544 --> 00:09:01.014
Message from the secondary squad.

00:09:02.684 --> 00:09:05.204
Hello? How's it going on your end?

00:09:05.554 --> 00:09:08.154
Sir! Just as you planned, Major.

00:09:08.154 --> 00:09:10.554
I'm sending you data on his powers now.

00:09:11.224 --> 00:09:15.284
Don't think badly of us.
After all, we saved your lives.

00:09:16.534 --> 00:09:18.364
Just as I thought.

00:09:23.774 --> 00:09:24.754
There you are!

00:09:25.374 --> 00:09:27.674
I'll go and finish this right now!

00:09:29.044 --> 00:09:30.944
He's leaving us behind?! Hey!

00:09:34.714 --> 00:09:37.774
That's not very friendly. After I
came all this way to see you.

00:09:38.414 --> 00:09:40.444
Kyosuke Hyobu...

00:09:44.124 --> 00:09:47.494
No introductions? Oh well, then.

00:09:53.864 --> 00:09:54.924
Mom...

00:09:55.734 --> 00:09:59.004
PSYCHIC POLE FISHING!

00:10:01.774 --> 00:10:04.074
I see. Hyobu did that...

00:10:04.844 --> 00:10:07.084
He seems to have prevented the
assassination of the president.

00:10:07.084 --> 00:10:08.744
We still don't have the full story.

00:10:13.484 --> 00:10:15.044
What's wrong, Kaoru?

00:10:15.954 --> 00:10:18.354
Didn't you feel that just now?

00:10:18.754 --> 00:10:20.294
Huh? Feel what?

00:10:20.294 --> 00:10:22.454
Don't start talking like a telepath.

00:10:22.994 --> 00:10:26.024
An esper. One of us, and he's suffering.

00:10:26.764 --> 00:10:28.424
We have to save him!

00:10:31.404 --> 00:10:33.134
I feel great.

00:10:37.274 --> 00:10:38.864
I'm still ready to shoot!

00:10:39.144 --> 00:10:41.484
Director! Please hurry up!

00:10:41.484 --> 00:10:43.474
It's an emergency!

00:10:43.654 --> 00:10:46.824
I can't just roll out of bed and go out!

00:10:46.824 --> 00:10:48.484
It's okay! You don't need makeup!

00:10:48.484 --> 00:10:50.054
You're pretty enough as is!

00:10:50.054 --> 00:10:52.924
Shut up! When I say wait, you wait!

00:10:52.994 --> 00:10:54.354
SOMEWHERE IN THE CITY - 16:07

00:10:57.694 --> 00:10:59.994
It's no use, Kyosuke Hyobu.

00:11:00.864 --> 00:11:02.594
In the end, you're too naive.

00:11:09.844 --> 00:11:10.674
Damn!

00:11:12.914 --> 00:11:16.374
You should have killed him the
instant you made your move.

00:11:16.784 --> 00:11:20.944
In the end, you're just a second-rate crime boss.

00:11:21.154 --> 00:11:23.994
I'll admit, you're worse than I am.

00:11:23.994 --> 00:11:25.954
An esper wouldn't do this to one of their own!

00:11:26.294 --> 00:11:27.724
Oh?

00:11:27.724 --> 00:11:29.694
Brainwashing that even you can't break...

00:11:29.694 --> 00:11:32.194
Is that something a Normal can do?

00:11:32.194 --> 00:11:35.034
You started off by capturing
a wizard-level Hypno user

00:11:35.234 --> 00:11:38.034
and then used them to take control
of other espers, one by one.

00:11:38.704 --> 00:11:40.144
Kid! Can you hear me?!

00:11:40.144 --> 00:11:42.264
Suppress the Black Phantom in your mind!

00:11:43.014 --> 00:11:47.704
He is the black will of the Normals.
The natural enemy of us espers!

00:11:48.244 --> 00:11:49.304
Don't obey him!

00:11:49.914 --> 00:11:51.854
Join us in PANDRA!

00:11:55.084 --> 00:11:56.554
Die, PANDRA.

00:11:56.554 --> 00:11:58.494
You people disgust me!

00:12:04.294 --> 00:12:06.424
The bullets in my body
are transforming, growing!

00:12:07.464 --> 00:12:10.694
He's manipulating the lead in them,
and using clairvoyance to guide them!

00:12:11.174 --> 00:12:12.724
You're a powerful enemy.

00:12:13.244 --> 00:12:15.264
Saving you will be difficult.

00:12:19.444 --> 00:12:21.244
You used your own blood to
push the bullets out?

00:12:22.344 --> 00:12:24.744
Come and get me, kid.

00:12:25.914 --> 00:12:29.584
Hey, wait! You can't go!
We're in the middle of a mission!

00:12:29.994 --> 00:12:31.794
I have to!

00:12:31.794 --> 00:12:33.024
Aoi, please!

00:12:33.694 --> 00:12:34.284
But...

00:12:35.294 --> 00:12:40.034
Let's check it out. If Kaoru's sensing
something, there must be something to it.

00:12:40.034 --> 00:12:42.764
That's what I don't get!
Give me a real explanation!

00:12:43.174 --> 00:12:44.434
Oh, well.

00:12:44.834 --> 00:12:46.304
Hey! Wait!

00:12:46.874 --> 00:12:48.894
Prep BABEL 1! We're going after them.

00:12:49.474 --> 00:12:52.304
Could it be... Has he?!

00:13:08.294 --> 00:13:11.124
Calm down and go back to your work, Queen.

00:13:11.294 --> 00:13:14.134
Sorry, but I'm going through,
even if I have to blast you!

00:13:19.974 --> 00:13:21.044
Don't underestimate us!

00:13:21.044 --> 00:13:23.034
How about you explain what's going on?

00:13:23.244 --> 00:13:25.374
Don't waste your time, Empress.

00:13:25.774 --> 00:13:30.554
You're right. It's hard to use
psychometry on a high-level esper.

00:13:30.554 --> 00:13:32.674
This little guy, on the other hand...

00:13:35.384 --> 00:13:37.224
How'd you know I was there?

00:13:37.224 --> 00:13:41.224
You'll just get the same result.
Momotaro's a high-level esper, too.

00:13:41.224 --> 00:13:43.364
Tell me, and I'll give you candy.

00:13:43.364 --> 00:13:45.994
Oh, well, the thing about Black Phantom

00:13:45.994 --> 00:13:48.934
You little rodent!
is that it isn't actually an esper crime syndicate.

00:13:48.934 --> 00:13:51.034
Apparently, kidnapped espers

00:13:51.034 --> 00:13:53.874
are hypnotized by Normals
to be used as their tools.

00:13:53.874 --> 00:13:56.244
Kyosuke's fighting to free them
from their brainwashing.

00:13:58.174 --> 00:14:00.044
Well, there you have it.

00:14:00.284 --> 00:14:03.044
If they can't be deprogrammed,
they have to be killed.

00:14:03.484 --> 00:14:06.004
The major's taken the entire
burden upon himself alone.

00:14:06.354 --> 00:14:09.754
Using espers, stealing their minds...

00:14:09.754 --> 00:14:11.414
Attacking other espers and Normals?

00:14:12.454 --> 00:14:14.424
The major isn't a mere criminal.

00:14:14.964 --> 00:14:19.094
PANDRA exists to fight these sorts of people.

00:14:21.334 --> 00:14:22.504
Kaoru!

00:14:22.504 --> 00:14:25.104
Now be good and go back to Mr. Glasses.

00:14:25.104 --> 00:14:25.794
But!

00:14:26.234 --> 00:14:29.044
Do that, and I can go back up the major.

00:14:29.044 --> 00:14:31.274
We're the only ones here who need
to dirty our hands with this.

00:14:37.784 --> 00:14:40.414
If they can't be deprogrammed,
they have to be killed.

00:14:41.124 --> 00:14:45.424
I see. Hyobu's doing this because
it's what we want, as well.

00:14:45.424 --> 00:14:46.684
You mean...

00:14:46.894 --> 00:14:49.794
You mean we should just run
away and not do anything?!

00:14:50.864 --> 00:14:56.004
We might be able to do something!
We're The Children!

00:14:56.004 --> 00:14:57.064
Kaoru!

00:14:59.534 --> 00:15:00.474
Minamoto!

00:15:00.774 --> 00:15:02.934
Go, Kaoru! I'll back you up!

00:15:03.274 --> 00:15:03.864
Right!

00:15:05.274 --> 00:15:07.574
I won't let you! The major ordered it!

00:15:14.354 --> 00:15:16.044
Momotaro, where's Mr. Hyobu?

00:15:16.554 --> 00:15:18.214
B-But Kyosuke said...

00:15:18.594 --> 00:15:19.654
Please!

00:15:20.324 --> 00:15:23.264
We're not going to let you
people call the shots here!

00:15:24.064 --> 00:15:25.754
So immature...

00:15:26.134 --> 00:15:28.464
So... Your name's Magi, huh?

00:15:28.834 --> 00:15:30.134
You!

00:15:30.134 --> 00:15:32.624
You were so busy talking,
you left your mind wide open.

00:15:33.034 --> 00:15:35.774
Shiho! His hair's been configured with carbon!

00:15:35.774 --> 00:15:36.464
Use electricity!

00:15:36.774 --> 00:15:39.474
Roger! This should work better than a gun.

00:15:40.014 --> 00:15:43.454
I could kick her off easily, but the
major doesn't want them harmed.

00:15:43.454 --> 00:15:45.314
Meaning, in this case...

00:15:45.854 --> 00:15:48.184
I'll just have to take it!

00:15:49.924 --> 00:15:51.914
Good! Now follow Kaoru, fast!

00:15:59.434 --> 00:16:00.394
Here?!

00:16:03.374 --> 00:16:04.434
A kid?

00:16:04.434 --> 00:16:07.274
I figured you'd end up coming.

00:16:08.004 --> 00:16:09.634
All that work, down the drain.

00:16:09.844 --> 00:16:14.444
Is that kid being manipulated by
Black Phantom? I'll help, too!

00:16:14.444 --> 00:16:15.674
No! Keep back!

00:16:17.084 --> 00:16:19.644
I couldn't break his brainwashing.

00:16:19.814 --> 00:16:21.984
The only way to save him now

00:16:22.284 --> 00:16:23.384
is to kill him!

00:16:23.794 --> 00:16:26.624
You think I'll keep letting you
close the distance with me?!

00:16:27.824 --> 00:16:30.124
Do I hit him with psychokinesis? No...

00:16:33.194 --> 00:16:36.764
When you teleport, movement the instant before
you appear gives your position away.

00:16:37.534 --> 00:16:38.194
Mr. Hyobu!

00:16:41.404 --> 00:16:43.434
No good. That's an illusion.

00:16:48.784 --> 00:16:51.254
Good night! You're finished!

00:16:51.254 --> 00:16:52.114
No!

00:16:55.854 --> 00:16:57.984
Mr. Hyobu, you can't!

00:16:58.554 --> 00:17:01.724
What have you done?! There's no other choice!

00:17:01.724 --> 00:17:03.494
Even so, don't do it!

00:17:04.094 --> 00:17:07.164
You've saved me over and over!

00:17:07.164 --> 00:17:10.464
Today, I'm going to make this work, somehow!

00:17:12.474 --> 00:17:16.434
I think Kyosuke's in real trouble.
That damage looks real.

00:17:18.414 --> 00:17:20.544
Thanks for the help, little girl.

00:17:20.544 --> 00:17:23.274
Here's a token of gratitude!

00:17:26.724 --> 00:17:27.954
Why, you!

00:17:27.954 --> 00:17:29.484
Momotaro, stop!

00:17:29.484 --> 00:17:30.654
Why?

00:17:30.654 --> 00:17:33.994
I'm not sure why, but we can't just attack him!

00:17:34.294 --> 00:17:36.494
I have a feeling the power controlling him

00:17:36.494 --> 00:17:38.434
just gets stronger when he's attacked!

00:17:39.494 --> 00:17:41.694
She can sense Hypno power?

00:17:42.434 --> 00:17:44.674
Black Phantom probably exploited

00:17:44.674 --> 00:17:48.164
weaknesses in his heart when they
hypnotized him. Perhaps...

00:17:50.214 --> 00:17:52.804
There's strong hatred in him
that the Hypno's exploiting.

00:17:53.844 --> 00:17:54.604
Shiho!

00:17:55.114 --> 00:17:57.674
This is your hometown, isn't it?

00:17:58.284 --> 00:17:59.884
Get out, you monster!

00:17:59.884 --> 00:18:01.854
We don't want espers in this town!

00:18:02.024 --> 00:18:03.054
Murderer!

00:18:03.054 --> 00:18:05.824
No! They were robbing me!

00:18:05.824 --> 00:18:08.314
They attacked my mom! And so, I...

00:18:08.724 --> 00:18:11.194
I never wanted this power!

00:18:12.434 --> 00:18:15.424
DON'T TOUCH ME!

00:18:17.934 --> 00:18:18.834
Sorry for the wait.

00:18:18.834 --> 00:18:19.534
Aoi!

00:18:20.404 --> 00:18:22.944
You fool! I was trying to...

00:18:22.944 --> 00:18:25.114
Restrain him! The Children!

00:18:25.114 --> 00:18:26.134
Roger!

00:18:26.744 --> 00:18:28.614
Stop them, Minamoto!

00:18:28.614 --> 00:18:30.204
And you just shut up!

00:18:30.854 --> 00:18:32.854
Those three can do this.

00:18:32.854 --> 00:18:35.784
And I'm here to help where
their inexperience can't!

00:18:36.084 --> 00:18:38.484
Well, aren't we just full of ourselves?

00:18:39.454 --> 00:18:41.584
Even with my gun sealed, it's too late!

00:18:42.194 --> 00:18:44.664
Oh, no, you don't! We knew you'd do this!

00:18:48.534 --> 00:18:51.364
He's probably expecting a close-range attack.

00:18:52.134 --> 00:18:54.974
There're better things to use as a shield, right?

00:18:54.974 --> 00:18:56.564
Huh? Of course!

00:19:04.814 --> 00:19:06.804
Making me dodge my own bullets!

00:19:07.884 --> 00:19:08.444
Gotcha!

00:19:12.024 --> 00:19:15.724
This guy can move things besides bullets?!

00:19:17.064 --> 00:19:20.664
Esper battles are about fighting an
opponent who follows different rules.

00:19:20.664 --> 00:19:23.564
Distract them, and you create an opening!

00:19:24.674 --> 00:19:25.664
Why, you!

00:19:29.604 --> 00:19:30.774
Stay away!

00:19:30.774 --> 00:19:31.534
Kaoru!

00:19:31.744 --> 00:19:33.374
You're concentrating all your power on defense.

00:19:33.444 --> 00:19:36.644
Too bad I still have some power to call on!

00:19:39.754 --> 00:19:41.744
Stop it! We're trying to help you!

00:19:42.724 --> 00:19:46.124
I can smell lead from that girl. My favorite smell!

00:19:46.594 --> 00:19:48.094
Stop it, please!

00:19:48.094 --> 00:19:49.254
Don't!

00:19:49.524 --> 00:19:50.764
I warned you!

00:19:50.764 --> 00:19:54.104
Wait! We've been waiting for
him to use his full power!

00:19:54.104 --> 00:19:54.584
What?

00:19:55.334 --> 00:19:57.764
The Children! Triple Boost!

00:19:59.674 --> 00:20:01.074
Full release!

00:20:01.444 --> 00:20:01.994
< < FULL RELEASE> >

00:20:04.574 --> 00:20:05.504
What?

00:20:13.954 --> 00:20:16.954
Boost? Mio mentioned it before.

00:20:16.954 --> 00:20:17.884
Now's your chance!

00:20:19.324 --> 00:20:20.224
Roger!

00:20:30.064 --> 00:20:32.904
It's no good! His psychokinesis
will overwhelm them!

00:20:34.044 --> 00:20:36.304
The boost will only last a few more seconds!

00:20:36.304 --> 00:20:38.034
Any more, and they'll be!

00:20:40.414 --> 00:20:42.404
I won't let you!

00:20:48.984 --> 00:20:51.324
An abnormal psychic wave!
It wasn't designed to do this!

00:20:51.554 --> 00:20:53.084
Kaoru, wait!

00:20:53.454 --> 00:20:55.894
She's taking the last drop of our power!

00:20:56.424 --> 00:20:57.694
What's this light?!

00:20:58.164 --> 00:21:01.534
Psychic Force Of Absolution.

00:21:16.344 --> 00:21:18.014
She destroyed the Hypno?

00:21:18.014 --> 00:21:20.244
That level of brainwashing, without killing him?

00:21:22.584 --> 00:21:23.384
K-Kaoru!

00:21:23.384 --> 00:21:24.154
Kaoru!

00:21:24.154 --> 00:21:25.654
She's unconscious!

00:21:25.654 --> 00:21:27.214
Teleport her down gently.

00:21:28.224 --> 00:21:29.694
Kaoru!

00:21:32.094 --> 00:21:34.434
You blew it, Minamoto.

00:21:34.704 --> 00:21:35.794
Didn't you see?

00:21:35.864 --> 00:21:38.894
With a single shot, she freed him from
brainwashing which I couldn't break.

00:21:39.434 --> 00:21:42.044
That wasn't just her drawing
power from her friends.

00:21:42.044 --> 00:21:44.474
She instinctively forged an entirely new one.

00:21:44.974 --> 00:21:47.034
The protector of espers.

00:21:47.444 --> 00:21:49.974
That is her true form!

00:21:50.914 --> 00:21:51.744
What are you saying?

00:21:51.814 --> 00:21:53.724
I think you know.

00:21:53.724 --> 00:21:56.244
She is the esper messiah!

00:21:57.094 --> 00:22:01.324
You, a Normal, are helping
to give birth to the queen.

00:22:01.324 --> 00:22:02.484
As you always shall.

00:22:21.384 --> 00:22:26.114
I embraced your boasting tight

00:22:26.114 --> 00:22:29.084
Even everything about your sad profile

00:22:29.084 --> 00:22:31.454
I love

00:22:31.454 --> 00:22:35.624
Girl who gets stronger with
every wall she breaks

00:22:35.624 --> 00:22:41.534
My eyes will never wander from you

00:22:41.804 --> 00:22:46.834
Because these too-honest feelings in my heart

00:22:46.834 --> 00:22:50.344
Can't be beaten by anyone

00:22:50.344 --> 00:22:53.474
I absolutely will never let you go

00:22:53.474 --> 00:22:55.644
No matter when or why

00:22:55.644 --> 00:23:00.824
And I'll change that still-unseen last scene

00:23:00.824 --> 00:23:05.154
Devils and angels both have wings

00:23:05.154 --> 00:23:10.794
So let's aim for higher skies

00:23:10.794 --> 00:23:15.504
Don't let your smile be clouded anymore

00:23:15.504 --> 00:23:18.074
When the hopes that connect us now

00:23:18.074 --> 00:23:21.874
Rip the darkness apart

00:23:21.874 --> 00:23:24.804
Together, you and I

00:23:25.044 --> 00:23:30.714
Will fly towards the future, Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.664 --> 00:23:41.464
< < NEXT EPISODE> >

00:23:41.464 --> 00:23:41.964
< < NEXT EPISODE> >
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.964 --> 00:23:43.594
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.594 --> 00:23:44.394
Minamoto!

00:23:44.394 --> 00:23:45.194
Who are?

00:23:45.194 --> 00:23:46.834
Sorry for the wait, Minamoto.

00:23:46.834 --> 00:23:48.464
K-Kaoru?

00:23:49.504 --> 00:23:51.524
What's wrong? Don't you feel well?

00:23:51.674 --> 00:23:52.504
Mr. Minamoto!

00:23:52.574 --> 00:23:53.604
He's unconscious!

00:23:53.604 --> 00:23:56.274
Who's doing this? Why would
they do this to Minamoto?!

00:23:56.274 --> 00:23:57.464
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:57.714 --> 00:24:01.284
Episode 38! "The Butterfly's Dream.
Dream Maker!"

00:24:01.284 --> 00:24:03.904
I've got you! It's show time!

00:24:03.984 --> 00:24:06.244
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.684 --> 00:24:09.954
The Butterfly's Dream!
Dream Maker
